{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a series of cataclysmic events, people begin to disappear and you are not an exception. Your morning starts as usual, you wake up and get ready for the day, but all of a sudden a deafening noise comes from outside. You go to investigate, only to come face to face with a peculiar object. As you touch it, a voice echoes from the sky. Out of nowhere a crystal looking creature emerges. You try to run, but your body won't listen, an unimaginable sense of fear makes its presence felt as you are hurled by a wind so strong that it peels off small pieces of your skin. You find yourself lost in an unknown plane of existence where the perception of reality is distorted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Will you be able to escape?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br>Explore places beyond imagination <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057320/extras/392ffbcc68914fd1ad8436497859dd40.poster.avif?t=1770716052\" width=512 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057320/extras/392ffbcc68914fd1ad8436497859dd40.webm?t=1770716052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057320/extras/392ffbcc68914fd1ad8436497859dd40.mp4?t=1770716052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Stay sharp<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057320/extras/c37c0112c41a7527d26daed5ab7b6d1b.poster.avif?t=1770716052\" width=512 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057320/extras/c37c0112c41a7527d26daed5ab7b6d1b.webm?t=1770716052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057320/extras/c37c0112c41a7527d26daed5ab7b6d1b.mp4?t=1770716052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Outrun danger <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057320/extras/c5d564bda7fa93f0db63e3b9d08859ae.poster.avif?t=1770716052\" width=512 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057320/extras/c5d564bda7fa93f0db63e3b9d08859ae.webm?t=1770716052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057320/extras/c5d564bda7fa93f0db63e3b9d08859ae.mp4?t=1770716052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Fight your way out <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057320/extras/099b35c2b94d59f0474b24f336145347.poster.avif?t=1770716052\" width=512 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057320/extras/099b35c2b94d59f0474b24f336145347.webm?t=1770716052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057320/extras/099b35c2b94d59f0474b24f336145347.mp4?t=1770716052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Game Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>-Linear gameplay:</strong> Atmospheric, story-driven experience. <br><strong>-Puzzles and Riddles:</strong>\u00a0Solve puzzles that will guide you to the way out. <br><strong>-Exploration:</strong> Enter the unknown and discover its hidden secrets. <br><strong>-Minimal Combat:</strong>\u00a0Start defenseless, but there are tools that will aid you. <br><strong>-Multiple endings:</strong> Choose one of the two endings and find out how this story ends.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4057320?t=1770716052","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4057320?t=1770716052","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057320/0678f491d125f715fe2f371d48ab02ed74a7b8a9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770716052","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057320/0678f491d125f715fe2f371d48ab02ed74a7b8a9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770716052","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4060120,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a series of cataclysmic events, people begin to disappear and you are not an exception. Your morning starts as usual, you wake up and get ready for the day, but all of a sudden a deafening noise comes from outside. You go to investigate, only to come face to face with a peculiar object. As you touch it, a voice echoes from the sky. Out of nowhere a crystal looking creature emerges. You try to run, but your body won't listen, an unimaginable sense of fear makes its presence felt as you are hurled by a wind so strong that it peels off small pieces of your skin. You find yourself lost in an unknown plane of existence where the perception of reality is distorted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Will you be able to escape?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br>Explore places bey